   "text": "Which letter is missing?",
   "t": 332.941,
   "dur": 1.311
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "W!",
   "t": 336.503,
   "dur": 0.649
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Letters can be small too! Let's write some!",
   "t": 338.602,
   "dur": 2.32
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Small a! Round, and a line down!",
   "t": 341.372,
   "dur": 1.978
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Small b! Line down, and a tummy!",
   "t": 345.05,
   "dur": 1.741
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Small c! A little curve!",
   "t": 348.492,
   "dur": 1.502
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Small d! Round, and a tall line!",
   "t": 351.694,
   "dur": 1.985
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Small e! Across, and curve around!",
   "t": 355.379,
   "dur": 2.11
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Small o! A little circle!",
   "t": 359.188,
   "dur": 1.392
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Small i! Line down, and a dot!",
   "t": 362.28,
   "dur": 2.026
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Small t! Line down, and a little cross!",
   "t": 366.007,
   "dur": 2.177
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Small n! Line down, and a hump!",
   "t": 369.884,
   "dur": 1.98
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Small u! Down, around, up, and down!",
   "t": 373.564,
   "dur": 2.014
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "We can write numbers too! One to five!",
   "t": 377.777,
   "dur": 1.975
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Number one! One line down!",
   "t": 380.203,
   "dur": 1.727
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Number two! Curve around, and across!",
   "t": 383.729,
   "dur": 2.001
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Number three! Bump, bump!",
   "t": 387.53,
   "dur": 1.518
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "Number four! Slant, across, and down!",
   "t": 390.848,
   "dur": 1.968
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Number five! Down, big bump, and a hat on top!",
   "t": 394.616,
   "dur": 2.791
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Pencils are not the only way to write!",
   "t": 399.707,
   "dur": 1.994
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "You can write with a crayon!",
   "t": 402.151,
   "dur": 1.397
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "You can write with chalk, on a board!",
   "t": 404.298,
   "dur": 1.757
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "You can even write with your finger, in the sand!",
   "t": 406.806,
   "dur": 2.164
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Letters make words! Let's write some words!",
   "t": 410.22,
   "dur": 2.417
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "C, A, T! Cat!",
   "t": 413.087,
   "dur": 1.073
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "S, U, N! Sun!",
   "t": 415.71,
   "dur": 1.121
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "D, O, G! Dog!",
   "t": 418.381,
   "dur": 1.182
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "H, A, T! Hat!",
   "t": 421.113,
   "dur": 1.244
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "F, I, S, H! Fish!",
   "t": 423.907,
   "dur": 1.269
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "B, A, L, L! Ball!",
   "t": 426.727,
   "dur": 1.295
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "The best word to write is your name!",
   "t": 430.072,
   "dur": 1.696
  },
  {
   "who": "gul",
   "text": "G, U, L! That's my name! Gul!",
   "t": 432.218,
   "dur": 1.746
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "M, I, S, H, U! That's my name! Mishu!",
   "t": 435.314,
   "dur": 2.557
  },
  {
   "who": "both",
   "text": "Now, can you write your name?",
   "t": 439.221,
   "dur": 1.382
  },
  {
   "who": "mishu",
   "text": "Stand up! Let's write in the air!",
